    <marc:datafield tag="520" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
      <marc:subfield code="a">This Little Builder is a delightful rhyming touch-and-feel book from Ladybird , with a different busy builder to talk about and a big touchy feely item to explore on every double page. From a shiny hard hat and hi-vis jacket to leathery boots and scratchy rough bricks, each builder-themed tactile area helps to stimulate sensory awareness in older babies and toddlers and teach them the difference between smooth, rough, bumpy, shiny and so on.</marc:subfield>
